  "idea": "How to schedule emails to send at a later date and time automatically",
  "text": "Use the built-in schedule send button to deliver your emails at nine on Monday morning. Sending proposals over the weekend makes you look disorganized and completely available outside normal business hours. Off-hours emails invite frantic weekend replies while getting buried underneath routine corporate newsletters. In Gmail or Outlook, click the Send dropdown and schedule delivery for tomorrow morning at nine. You look completely professional while protecting your personal time.",
